Package: tensorrt
Version: 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: objectScanner local runtime image
Depends: libnvinfer10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvinfer-bin (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvinfer-dispatch10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvinfer-lean10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvinfer-plugin10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvinfer-vc-plugin10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0), libnvonnxparsers10 (= 10.13.3.9-1+cuda13.0)
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Description: Runtime-only TensorRT metapackage for Isaac ROS FoundationPose
 This local metapackage satisfies Isaac ROS's TensorRT dependency while
 deliberately omitting development headers, static libraries, samples, and
 Windows engine-builder resources that are not needed to run FoundationPose.
